<title>UK: Rabobank sets 150 bln lire 10-yr fixed/reverse FRN. [CORRECTED 16:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 150 bln lire 10-yr fixed/reverse FRN. [CORRECTED 16:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Credit Italiano and Norgan Stanley International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND</p>
<p> AMT    150 BLN LIRE  COUPON    *8.00	MATURITY    14.FEB.07</p>
<p>(Lead manager corrects maturity date from 13.FEB.07 to 14.FEB.07)</p>
<p> TYPE FIXED/REV FRN   ISS PRICE  101.10    PAY DATE    14.FEB.97</p>
<p>(Lead manager corrects payment date from 13.FEB.97 to 14.FEB.97)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER  **99.425    SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST FIVE YEARS THEN 19.5 PERCENT LESS TWO</p>
<p>		TIMES SIX MONTH LIBOR.</p>
<p>	    **RECOMMENDED REOFFER.</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.625</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
